<h1>Engagement Shape Decision — <code>&lt;CLIENT&gt;</code> — <code>&lt;ENGAGEMENT&gt;</code></h1>
<ul><li><strong>decision_id:</strong> <code>fvh-&lt;slug&gt;</code></li><li><strong>decider:</strong> <code>@&lt;handle&gt;</code></li><li><strong>decided_at:</strong> <code>&lt;YYYY-MM-DD&gt;</code></li><li><strong>reassessment_at_25pct:</strong> <code>&lt;YYYY-MM-DD&gt;</code></li></ul>
<h2>Scope summary</h2>
<p>&lt;one paragraph&gt;</p>
<h2>Signal scores</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Signal</th><th>Score</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>scope_clarity</td><td>low / medium / high</td><td>&lt;source&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>change_rate</td><td>low / medium / high</td><td>&lt;source&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>client_maturity</td><td>low / medium / high</td><td>&lt;source&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>domain_familiarity</td><td>low / medium / high</td><td>&lt;source&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Options considered</h2>
<ul><li>fixed: {{ fixed }}</li><li>hourly: {{ hourly }}</li><li>hybrid: {{ hybrid }}</li></ul>
<h2>Chosen</h2>
<p><code>fixed | hourly | hybrid</code></p>
