<ul><li><code>fixed</code>: &lt;numeric threshold to reopen&gt;</li><li><code>hourly</code>: {{ numeric_threshold }}</li><li><code>hybrid</code>: {{ numeric_threshold }}</li></ul>
<h2>Reversal trigger</h2>
<p>&lt;numeric trigger that reopens the decision; ≥20 chars&gt;</p>
